  "tier_rules": {
    "1": "Short stems of three to six words. Concrete nouns such as apple, table, or turtle with a lemma picture. Distractors drop a letter or use a loud el ending.",
    "2": "Grade-level CLe words such as candle, circle, or little. Mix le/el and missing-e distractors. Picture when the word is a thing you can see.",
    "3": "Near-miss spellings of two-syllable CLe words such as eagle, people, or title. Include some <NAME> stems. Distractors look almost right."
  },
